From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] shcore: IStream_Copy, thread handle, dpi, registry readers, SHIsEmptyStream, MapWin32ErrorToSTG (2055)

shcore: IStream_Copy, SHCreateThreadWithHandle, dpi of the shell, HKCU then HKLM readers, SHIsEmptyStream, MapWin32ErrorToSTG.

IStream_Copy copies a count of bytes between streams. SHCreateThreadWithHandle
is SHCreateThread that hands back the thread's handle.
GetDpiForShellUIComponent gives the system's dots per inch.
SHRegGetValueFromHKCUHKLM and SHRegGetBoolValueFromHKCUHKLM read the user's
value and fall back to the machine's (a boolean may be a number or the text
yes, true, 1 and no, false, 0). SHIsEmptyStream tells an empty stream.
MapWin32ErrorToSTG gives the storage error of a Win32 one. They were stubs.
---
